WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.068
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.204
Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:08.507
This is it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.507 --> 00:00:09.909 line:0%
Well, guys, earlier today,

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.311 line:0%
President Biden and
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:16.049 line:0%
finally met for their big summit
in Geneva, Switzerland.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:17.316 line:0%
Yep. It was pretty much

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:20.553 line:0%
the opposite of
the "Friends" reunion.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.356
Yeah, Biden and Putin
met at this Swiss estate.

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.524
Yeah.
-Ooh!

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.492
-You may recognize it as
the haunted asylum

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.261
in every horror movie.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.996
Actually, Putin found
the place on his favorite

00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:33.165
house-rental site, AirKGB.

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:34.768
-Oh.

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:39.706
-Well, Biden and Putin
both arrived

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.207
within 20 minutes of each other.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.276
Here they are
shaking hands outside.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:48.848
[ Indistinct shouting,
camera shutters clicking ]

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:52.018
-Yeah. Meanwhile,
Trump was watching on TV like...

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:58.391
-♪ Don't you remember you
told me you loved me, baby? ♪

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.128
-Once the president
stepped inside,

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.896
they sat down
for another photo op.

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:06.833
Take a look at this. Yeah.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.602
Looked like two dads waiting for

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.638
their daughters to finish
trying on prom dresses.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:15.175
They're like, "That looks great,
honey, yeah."

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.409
Putin looks like
he's trying to remember

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.411
which one of those books
opens up the trapdoor.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.179
He's like, "Okay, this one..."

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:23.716
Say hello to the sharks,
Mr. Biden.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:27.020
There are some piranhas that
were -- Hold on."

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.088
Then Biden and Putin
got down to business,

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.290
where it was just them,

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:32.124
a red table,
and Jada Pinkett Smith.

00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:33.293
And that's what
I'm talking about.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:35.795
That's when it gets --
That's when they mean --

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.563
Let's get down to business.
Come on.

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:40.533
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.801
The meeting was
expected to be five hours

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:45.571
but lasted only half that time.

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:46.940
Not a great sign
when your summit

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:50.844
is barely longer than
"Peter Rabbit 2."

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:54.013
But after the meeting, the two
leaders agreed to keep in touch.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.682
When Biden said,
"I'll give you my e-mail,"

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:59.185
Putin said, "I already have your
e-mail and password.

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:02.154
And Venmo.
Don't worry about it."

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:03.256
And this is nice.

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.124
The White House
said Biden gave Putin

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:08.494
a pair of
custom aviator sunglasses.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:11.164
Yeah. Putin says he's excited
to wear the aviators

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:15.501
back home in Russia, where the
sun's out twice a year.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:20.439
Biden also gave Putin a
crystal sculpture of a bison.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:23.876
Yeah. A crystal bison.

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:25.144
Weirdly enough, Crystal Bison

00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:26.946
is also one of Trump's
old girlfriends.

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.781
-Really?
-Yeah. She's...

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:32.385
Oh, yeah.
-He paid her off -- $130,000.

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.854
-130 grand, yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.789
After the meeting,
Putin held a press conference

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.825
and was asked if he thinks
the U.S. and Russia

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:41.294
will now have
a better relationship.

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:42.962
And listen to his response.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:01.747
-What?

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:05.050
-Wow!
-What?!

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.187
-That's actually an
excerpt from Putin's new book,

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:08.654
"Chicken Soup
for the Russian Soul."

00:03:08.654 --> 00:03:10.322
-Oh.

00:03:10.322 --> 00:03:14.127
-"There's no happiness in life."
-Yeah.

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:16.762
-"There's no happiness in life."

00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:20.132
It sounds like the slogan
for Russian Applebee's.

00:03:20.132 --> 00:03:22.869
Switching gears,
according to an annual list

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:24.103
that was just released,

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:27.139
New Jersey is America's
best state to live in.

00:03:27.139 --> 00:03:28.207
-Yeah!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:28.207 --> 00:03:30.210
Yeah! Come on! Yes!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:33.913
[ Crowd booing, cheering ]
Yay! Yeah!

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:36.582
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:37.817
-Yeah! Come on!
-Wow!

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:40.253
Yeah, the key factors
they considered were

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:42.421
cost of living,
quality of education,

00:03:42.421 --> 00:03:44.791
and access to gabagool.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.062
-Oh!
♪♪

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:50.863
-Finally, speaking of
the Garden State,

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.932
yesterday,
at a New Jersey water park,

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:57.136
a water slide
actually caught on fire.

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:58.204
Take a look at this thing.

00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:01.007
Holy!
-Oh!

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:02.875
-There it is --
the best state to live in,

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:04.143
ladies and gentlemen.

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:07.280
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:10.850
A water slide...

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.052
Meanwhile, there was still
a 16-year-old lifeguard

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:16.255
at the top of the slide saying,
"You can go.

00:04:16.255 --> 00:04:17.990
You can go.

00:04:18.056 --> 00:04:19.825
You can go.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:22.428
You can go.
You can go.

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:23.962
[ Drumbeat ]

00:04:23.962 --> 00:04:25.231
[ Laughs ] You can go.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:27.500
[ Drumbeat ]
You can go. You can go.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.002
You can go. Yeah.
You can go.

00:04:30.002 --> 00:04:31.804
That's right -- the thing
just burst into flames,

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:34.741
which is why the slide's new
name is Gender Reveal Party.

